Package: melbfoot
Title: Explore Hourly Pedestrian Counts in Melbourne
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Inayat", "Gill", , "igil0008@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides hourly pedestrian counts from the City of Melbourne
    Pedestrian Counting System, summarised by sensor, year, day type and
    hour of day. Includes helper functions to build typical-day profiles and
    to measure how foot traffic changed relative to a baseline year, and a
    'shiny' app that helps business owners and event planners compare
    locations and years.
